[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:33.32]Jesus, Jesus, what's it all about?
[00:33.32]天呐 天呐 这一切究竟是怎么啦
[00:41.29]Trying a clout these little ingrates into shape
[00:41.29]把这些忘恩负义的小人碾成肉饼吧
[00:49.19]When I was their age all the lights went out
[00:49.19]当我像他们那般年纪 所有的灯光尽皆熄灭
[00:59.51]There was no time to whine and mope about
[00:59.51]根本没空怨天尤人抑郁消沉
[01:06.40]And even now part of me flies
[01:06.40]即便现在我身上有些东西已经飞走
[01:09.40]Over dresden at Angels one five
[01:09.40]越过五位一体天使庇护下的德累斯顿
[01:13.60]Though they'll never fathom it behind my sarcasm
[01:13.60]虽然他们从未看穿我背后的冷漠嘲笑
[01:17.84]Desperate memories lie
[01:17.84]但绝望心碎的记忆仍然留存
[01:23.62]Sweetheart, sweetheart are you fast asleep? Good
[01:23.62]甜心 甜心 你已经入睡了吗 好样的
[01:31.97]That's the only time that I can really speak to you
[01:31.97]那是唯一一次我对你侃侃谈起
[01:39.92]And there is something that I've locked away
[01:39.92]有些事情我一直深锁在心底
[01:46.68]A memory that is too painful to withstand the light of day
[01:46.68]过于悲痛的回忆令人畏惧白天刺眼的光
[01:57.09]And when we came back from the war
[01:57.09]当我们从战乱中光荣归来
[02:00.08]The banners and flags hung on everyone's door
[02:00.08]条幅和国旗悬挂在每一个人的家门前
[02:04.34]We danced and we sang in the street
[02:04.34]我们在大街上又唱又跳
[02:06.92]And the church bells rang
[02:06.92]教堂的钟声久久回响
[02:14.32]But burning in my heart
[02:14.32]但我内心仍然热血沸腾
[02:20.28]The memory smolders on
[02:20.28]记忆的余温尚存
[02:26.09]Of the gunners dying words
[02:26.09]枪手们的临死遗言
[02:32.18]On the intercom
[02:32.18]永远留在了对讲机里
